   ONE-CLICK PROD DEPLOYMENT — TERA Audit Program (SQL 2022)
   Includes:
   - Server Audit -> File (.sqlaudit)
   - DB Audit Spec -> DDL + SELECT on PHI tables
   - XE session -> Export signals (.xel)
   - Views: v_Audit_All, v_Audit_PHI_Selects, v_Report_PotentialExport
   - Tables: ExcludeLogins, SensitiveKeywords, ADGroupCategory,
             UserCategoryCache, AlertWatermark
   - Procs: usp_Refresh_AuditUserCategoryCache,
            usp_Alert_PHI_WhereSensitive_NewOnly,
            usp_Email_Weekly_Audit_Pack
   - Jobs: 10-sec alert + weekly pack
